    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n67636" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μηχᾰνο-ποιός</span></b> , ὁ,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>maker of engines</i> or
				<i>machines, engineer</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Grg.</u>
				512b
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>Cyr.</u>
				6.1.22
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Ostr.Bodl.</u>
				 i 304
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(ii B. C.)</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Sallust.
				8
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>machinist</i> of the theatre, <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Pax</u>
				174
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Fr.</u>
				188
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b> metaph., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μ. τῆς ὅλης ὑποθέσεως</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Jul.
					<u>Or.</u>
					2.59b
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			Adj.
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μ. πλῆθος</span> multitude <i>of
				siege-engines</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Memn.
				37
			</span></i>.</div>
